name textpos
category Package
revision 77682
shortdesc Place boxes at arbitrary positions on the LaTeX page
longdesc A package to facilitate the placement of boxes at absolute
longdesc positions on the LaTeX page. There are several reasons why this
longdesc might be useful, one important example being to help the
longdesc creation of large-format conference posters.
